{"speciesId":791,"names":{"fr":"Solgaleo","es":"Solgaleo","en":"Solgaleo","ja":"ソルガレオ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il viendrait d’un autre monde. Tout son corps émet une puissante lumière qui peut changer la nuit la plus noire en un jour radieux."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se cree que proviene de otro mundo. El brillo que emite su cuerpo es tal que puede hacer que la noche más profunda parezca pleno día."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It is said to live in another world. The intense light it radiates from the surface of its body can make the darkest of nights light up like midday."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"別世界に 棲むと いわれる。 全身から 激しい光を 放ち 闇夜も 真昼のように 照らすのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"On suppose que c’est l’évolution de Cosmog lorsqu’il s’agit d’un mâle. Son troisième œil apparaît quand il s’en va vers un autre monde."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se dice que es la evolución final macho de Cosmog. Cuando su tercer ojo se abre, parte hacia otro mundo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon is said to be a male evolution of Cosmog. At the activation of its third eye, it departs for another world."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"コスモッグが 進化した ♂だと いわれる。 第３の 眼が 浮かぶとき 別世界へと 駆け抜けていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Lorsqu’il ouvre une Ultra-Brèche, il arrive que de l’énergie et des formes de vie d’autres mondes se retrouvent dans le nôtre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Es capaz de crear Ultraumbrales a través de los cuales formas de vida y energía procedentes de otros mundos acuden al nuestro."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sometimes the result of its opening an Ultra Wormhole is that energy and life-forms from other worlds are called here to this world."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ウルトラホールを 開いた 結果 異世界の エネルギーや 生命を この世界に 呼ぶことも あるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Des documents extrêmement anciens le décrivent comme « celui qui dévore le soleil »."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Aparece en obras de la literatura antigua en las que se refieren a él como “la criatura que se nutre del sol”."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"In writings from the distant past, it’s called by the name “the beast that devours the sun.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"遥か 大昔の 文献に 太陽を 喰らいし 獣と いう 名前で 記録が 残っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand tout son corps émet de la lumière et qu’il prend la forme du soleil, il peut repousser les ténèbres et illuminer le monde."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es capaz de eliminar toda oscuridad e iluminar el mundo entero irradiando luz por todo el cuerpo como si de un sol se tratara."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When light radiates from its body, this Pokémon could almost appear to be the sun. It will dispel any darkness and light up the world."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"全身から 光を 発して まるで 太陽の 姿になると 闇を 消して 世界を 照らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Jadis, on le surnommait « celui qui dévore le soleil ». Une lumière inextinguible rayonne de son corps."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Antiguamente era conocido como la Criatura que se Nutre del Sol. Emite sin cesar una energía luminosa."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Solgaleo was once known as the Beast That Devours the Sun. Energy in the form of light radiates boundlessly from it."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"太陽を 食らいし 獣 と かつて 呼ばれた。 無尽蔵の 光エネルギーを 放出する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":791,"moves":[{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"flamethrower","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,